# Pairs with CommittedBatchOnBoundCopy. A straggling routed prepare is not refused
# by a leaf that remembers the saga's discard, so it recreates a bucket on a copy
# the saga left after the decision.
MODULE: CommittedBatchOnBoundCopyStragglerLands
TARGET: CommittedBatchOnBoundCopy
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a late prepare lands on a leaf that discarded the saga
PERTURBS: Land

--- FIND
    /\ pend' = IF RoutedAdmits(c) /\ ~term[c][k] THEN [pend EXCEPT ![c][k] = TRUE] ELSE pend
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the leaf's memory of the discard does not refuse it.
    /\ pend' = IF RoutedAdmits(c) THEN [pend EXCEPT ![c][k] = TRUE] ELSE pend
--- END